ist","Psychiatric Nursing Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Forensic Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nursing","Forensic Medicine","Legal/Ethical Practice"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential settings include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Forensic medicine departments"},{"text":"Trauma centres"},{"text":"Victim-support services"},{"text":"Correctional healthcare settings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Critical Care Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICU"},{"text":"Patient monitoring"},{"text":"Emergency response"},{"text":"Critical-care technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Emergency Nursing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rapid assessment"},{"text":"Emergency stabilization"},{"text":"Trauma care"},{"text":"Acute patient management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Nursing Quality"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient safety"},{"text":"Clinical audits"},{"text":"Quality indicators"},{"text":"Accreditation"},{"text":"Infection control"}]}]},{"heading":"Technology Skills for the 2026+ Era","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Nursing is increasingly connected to digital healthcare."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Nursing Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Patient","Electronic Health Record","Nursing Assessment","Digital Care Plan","Medication / Monitoring","Clinical Documentation","Analytics"]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electronic Health Records"},{"text":"Hospital Information Systems"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic data analysis"},{"text":"Digital documentation"},{"text":"Telehealth"},{"text":"Clinical decision-support concepts"}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Future nursing environments may increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted clinical documen