"text":"Comprehensive clinical postings"},{"text":"Hospital internship"},{"text":"Psychiatric/mental-health exposure"},{"text":"Emergency/critical-care exposure"},{"text":"Specialty nursing exposure where available"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Nursing Officer","Specialty Nursing","Clinical/Forensic/Psychiatric Specialist","Nursing Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular pathway, clinical nursing competence and professional registration are the non-negotiable foundation. Forensic or psychiatric specialization can then provide differentiation, while digital health, quality management and leadership skills can support progression into senior clinical and administrative roles."}]}]}